      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T14:57:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suspect that a slightly off timestamp wouldn\u0027t cause any issues - I think we have that sometimes at suspend/resume. Although @jasongustaman@google.com again to confirm if there are any dependencies on timestamp values.",
